  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For micelle formation, which of the following statements are correct?</p><p>(A) Micelle formation is an exothermic process.</p><p>(B) Micelle formation is an endothermic process.</p><p>(C) The entropy change is positive.</p><p>(D) The entropy change is negative.</p>"
