  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For micelle formation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;S</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (hydrophobic effect).</p><p>This is possible because, the decrease in entropy due to clustering is offset by increase in entropy due to desolvation of the surfactant.</p><p>&nbsp;Also&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
